_💻 Can a single Frontend Developer build a complete SaaS Ecosystem for an Academy?_

Yes. I just launched Educa. — a feature-rich, full-stack Learning Management System (LMS) engineered for modern Tuition Academies and Educational Institutes! 🦾🔥
Designed to streamline both physical and hybrid education, educa. connects a high-performance frontend with real-time cloud data layers to provide separate, secure operational scopes for Students and Administrators.

💎 Key Features & Administrative Vaults:

Centralized Admin Panel – Onboarding students, uploading weekly papers/tutes, scheduling class timetables, and managing virtual Zoom session links all from one control center.

Live Broadcast Engine – Instantly publishing mandatory notices (Parent Meetings, Zoom Links, Postponements) with dynamic "LIVE NOW" status triggers.

Subject-Gated Student Dashboard – Automatically locks or unlocks study resources based on student enrollment classes (Maths, Science, English).

Verified ResultHub Ledger – A public portal streaming authenticated student O/L results with dynamic likes and moving golden animations.

Community CommentHub – An interactive public review board allowing past pupils and visitors to share genuine academic feedback.

Embedded AI Study Assistant – A client-side AI Tutor Bot inside the student terminal to instantly resolve math and science problems during self-study hours.

🛠️ Tech Stack:
React.js (Vite) | SASS/SCSS Architecture | Google Firebase Core | React Router DOM v6

